  "body": "I wrote that \"Ubuntu build recipe for ART\" back in 2023 when I was still using Ubuntu. But I have since migrated to Debian 12 (Bookworm). \nThe more recent binary Linux versions of ART that are now released on Github all work out of the box for me on Debian 12.\nSo I have not needed (or tried) to build it from source again since I migrated to Debian, and that build recipe is now probably very outdated.   \n\nSorry about that...",
